{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2012a.q25.material.recovered", "text": "星期一，A老师埋怨地说：“孩子在家过了一个双休日，再回到幼儿园后，许多良好的行为习惯就退步了，不认真吃饭，乱扔东西，活动时喜欢说话，真不知孩子在家时，家长是怎么教育的!”站在一旁的B老师颇有同感地说：“是啊，如果家长都能按我们的要求去教育孩子，我们的工作就好做多了!”A老师接着说：“可这些家长不按我们的要求去做倒也罢了，还经常给我们提这样那样的意见，好像我们当老师的还不如他们懂得多，真拿这些家长没有办法……”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1607, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1813, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012a.q25"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012a.q25"], "word_count": 206, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1607, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1813, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 25, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65"}], "type": "