{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2012a.q26.material.recovered", "text": "小班幼儿在角色游戏区活动，文文在邮局里无所事事，摆弄一个称重器。在此之前，孩子们没有“邮局”这个角色游戏的经验。教师看到这种情况，拿了一个盒子走过去，对文文说：“我想把这个寄到超市去(旁边有超市游戏区)，你能帮我称一下吗？”文文马上接过盒子，放在称重器上，看了一下，说：“100克!”教师问：“多少钱？”“10块钱。”教师假装付了钱，文文立刻把盒子送到了隔壁的超市。接着，有几个小朋友也学着教师的样子将一些东西寄到旁边的医院、美容院、娃娃家，邮局变得热闹起来。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1884, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2114, "next_source_question_number": 26, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 26, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012a.q26"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2012a.q26"], "word_count": 230, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc06d3bd46e65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1884, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2114, "next_source_question_number": 26, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 26, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8645ed77b1bf781fb4f0347e7aef8a87dcae185df58d025e166bc0